<div class="row-fluid-wrapper row-depth-1 row-number-20 ">
<div class="row-fluid ">
<div class="span12 widget-span widget-type-custom_widget " style="" data-widget-type="custom_widget" data-x="0" data-w="12">
<div id="hs_cos_wrapper_module_1568317357144586" class="hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_module" style="" data-hs-cos-general-type="widget" data-hs-cos-type="module"><div class="jr-table-container">
  <div class="jr-table-col ">
    <div class="jr-logo">
      
        <img src="https://www.sonatype.com/hubfs/2019%20Product%20logo/Vertical/NexusRepo_Vertical.svg" alt="NexusRepo_Vertical" width="132" height="132">
      
    </div>
    <div class="jr-band left">
      <div style="text-align: center;">Sonatype’s user-based model is predictable and will not increase as organizations continue to grow.</div>     
    </div>
    
      <div class="jr-table-box " style="min-height:150px;">
        <div style="text-align: center;">Active/Active High Availability</div>
<div class="jr-green-text" style="text-align: center;"><strong>BUILT IN</strong></div>
<div style="text-align: center;">Starts at</div>
<div style="text-align: center;"><span class="jr-big-text"> $5,000 </span><sup>/year*</sup></div>
      </div>
    
      <div class="jr-table-box " style="min-height:150px;">
        <div style="text-align: center;">Repository Health Check</div>
<div class="jr-green-text" style="text-align: center;"><strong>BUILT IN</strong></div>
<div style="text-align: center;"><span class="jr-big-text"> $0 </span><sup>/year</sup></div>
      </div>
    
      <div class="jr-table-box " style="min-height:150px;">
        <div style="text-align: center;">Universal Component Support</div>
<div class="jr-green-text" style="text-align: center;"><strong>FREE</strong></div>
<div style="text-align: center;">Included in OSS Version</div>
<em style="font-size: 12px;"><sup>*</sup>Based on 25 users</em>
      </div>
    
  </div>
  <div class="jr-table-vs">
   
    
  </div>
  <div class="jr-table-col">
    <div class="jr-logo">
      
        <img src="https://www.sonatype.com/hs-fs/hubfs/2019%20Product%20logo/Vertical/artifactoryJfrog.png?width=229&amp;height=142&amp;name=artifactoryJfrog.png" alt="artifactoryJfrog" width="229" height="142" srcset="https://www.sonatype.com/hs-fs/hubfs/2019%20Product%20logo/Vertical/artifactoryJfrog.png?width=115&amp;height=71&amp;name=artifactoryJfrog.png 115w, https://www.sonatype.com/hs-fs/hubfs/2019%20Product%20logo/Vertical/artifactoryJfrog.png?width=229&amp;height=142&amp;name=artifactoryJfrog.png 229w, https://www.sonatype.com/hs-fs/hubfs/2019%20Product%20logo/Vertical/artifactoryJfrog.png?width=344&amp;height=213&amp;name=artifactoryJfrog.png 344w, https://www.sonatype.com/hs-fs/hubfs/2019%20Product%20logo/Vertical/artifactoryJfrog.png?width=458&amp;height=284&amp;name=artifactoryJfrog.png 458w, https://www.sonatype.com/hs-fs/hubfs/2019%20Product%20logo/Vertical/artifactoryJfrog.png?width=573&amp;height=355&amp;name=artifactoryJfrog.png 573w, https://www.sonatype.com/hs-fs/hubfs/2019%20Product%20logo/Vertical/artifactoryJfrog.png?width=687&amp;height=426&amp;name=artifactoryJfrog.png 687w" sizes="(max-width: 229px) 100vw, 229px">
      
    </div>
    <div class="jr-band right">
      <div style="text-align: center;">JFrog’s server-based model significantly increases expenses year-over-year as customer usage increases, resulting in a higher total costs down the road</div>
    </div>
    
      <div class="jr-table-box " style="min-height:150px;">
        <div style="text-align: center;">Active/Active High Availability</div>
<div class="jr-red-text" style="text-align: center;"><strong>UPGRADE REQUIRED</strong></div>
<div style="text-align: center;">Pro Enterprise upgrade starts at</div>
<div style="text-align: center;"><span class="jr-big-text"> $29,500 </span><sup>/year</sup></div>
      </div>
    
